  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>틸<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby>어<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>어<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZOCqUC9a7wM?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>天<rt>틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>烏烏<rt>어ˉ어ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落雨<rt>롷허ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thḭ̂ ōr-ôr bêh-loh-hōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿公仔<rt>아ˉ겅ˉ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攑<rt>꺟-</rt></ruby><ruby>鋤頭<rt>듸ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>掘<rt>굳-</rt></ruby><ruby>芋<rt>어ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā-kōng-à giah-ti-tháu bêh-kut-ōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>掘<rt>굳ˆ</rt></ruby>’앟 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>掘<rt>굳ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>掘<rt>굳ˆ</rt></ruby>’앟 <ruby>掘<rt>굳ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kût’ah kût, kût’ah kût\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>掘<rt>굳-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>一尾<rt>짇쀄ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>旋鰡鼓<rt>솬ˉ류ˉ거ˋ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kut-tioh-jit-buê-soān-liū-kòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>얗헿<ruby>더<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>真正<rt>진ˉ쟐ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>趣味<rt>추ˋ삐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ī-yah-heh-tōr jīn-jià̰-chù-bī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿公仔<rt>아ˉ겅ˉ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮<rt>주ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>鹹<rt>걈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā-kōng-à bêh-jû-kiám\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煮<rt>주ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>䭕<rt>쟐ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā-mà bêh-jû-jià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>兩个<rt>능에ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>相拍<rt>쇼ˉ팧</rt></ruby> <ruby>挵破<rt>렁ˋ퐈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>鼎<rt>댤ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    nng-é siō-phah lòng-phoà-tià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>얗헿<ruby>더<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>렁<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>덩<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>친<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>덩<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>챵<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ī-yah-heh-tōr lōng-tōng-chìn-tōng-chiâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n    <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n        왛핳<ruby>하<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n        oah-hah-hā\n    </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 16px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span><ruby>旋鰡鼓<rt>솬ˉ류ˉ거ˋ</rt></ruby></span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 泥鰍。<br>\n      (en) Pond loach.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
